 ## How it works
 **Inputs:**
-1.  A normalized tetrahedral grid file (see Preprocessing).
-2.  A 4x4 transformation matrix.
-3.  Screen resolution (width $W$, height $H$).
-4.  Transfer functions for lighting and compositing.
