+2. A transformation matrix [S1, unofficial].
+3. Screen resolution (width $W$, height $H$) [S1, unofficial].
+4. Transfer functions for lighting and compositing [S1, unofficial].
 
 **Outputs:**
-1.  A rendered image buffer.
